      "description": {
        "fun": "Pichu hasn't learned to hold its charge yet: its tiny cheek pouches leak, so it zaps itself whenever it laughs or gets a fright, and its jolts surprise it as much as anyone. Pichu playing together sometimes short out in a shower of sparks and burst into tears. Added in Generation 2 as Pikachu's baby form, it's game director Junichi Masuda's favourite Pokémon of that generation.",
        "guide": "A small Electric baby Pokémon and the first stage of Pikachu's line, introduced in Generation 2. Its cheek pouches are too small to store much electricity, so it often shocks itself when startled or amused. It evolves into Pikachu with high friendship.",
        "tagline": "A baby Pikachu that shocks itself more than anyone",
        "sources": [
