      "description": {
        "fun": "Pikachu stores electricity in its red cheek pouches, which charge up overnight while it sleeps, so a dozy Pikachu may let off a spark when it wakes. It roasts Berries with its own current to soften them, sometimes a little too well. Its family is the only one with Mega Evolutions, its own Z-Moves and a Gigantamax form.",
        "guide": "A small, yellow Electric mouse Pokémon, best known as the mascot of the Pokémon franchise. It stores electricity in its red cheek pouches and releases it when threatened. Pikachu evolves into Raichu with a Thunder Stone and has many special forms, among them Cosplay Pikachu, Pikachu in a cap and Gigantamax Pikachu.",
        "tagline": "The electric mouse that became the face of Pokémon",
        "sources": [
          {
